	ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap.F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.UEContextSetupRequest.protocolIEs.Item 3.ProtocolIE-Field.value.CUtoDURRCInformation.iE-Extensions.Item 0.ProtocolExtensionField.extensionValue.HandoverPreparationInformation.HandoverPreparationInformation.criticalExtensions.c1.handoverPreparationInformation.sourceConfig.rrcReconfiguration.RRCReconfiguration.criticalExtensions.rrcReconfiguration.measConfig.reportConfigToAddModList.Item 2.ReportConfigToAddMod.reportConfig.reportConfigNR.reportType.eventTriggered.eventId = 2

